41
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do, Aoi?</font>

42
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go with Fukusuke.</font>

43
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go after Idate.</font>

44
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Right!</font>

45
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Idate!
The ocean is that way!</font>

46
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going!
Come back!</font>

47
00:01:57,130 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! There's no way
I'm going back!</font>

48
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

49
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

50
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that kid think
he's doing?</font>

51
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like he's run away.</font>

52
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate's been like that
from long ago.</font>

53
00:02:24,450 --> 00:02:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know him?</font>

54
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, kind of...</font>

55
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:40,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto Sinks?!</font>

56
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:40,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Great Ocean That</font>

57
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:40,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Swirls Conspiracy</font>

58
00:02:43,510 --> 00:02:45,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew he'd run away,
that bastard Idate.</font>

59
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knowing him this long,
you must've figured this would happen.</font>

60
00:02:50,230 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a mistake to let him run!</font>

61
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiots!
Idate isn't that kind of kid!</font>

62
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Boss!
— Boss...</font>

63
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe in Idate.</font>

64
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have a plan.</font>

65
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jirocho!</font>

66
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chief Retainer!</font>

67
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:11,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do you think
you're going to settle this?</font>

68
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've turned this grand traditional
festival into a mere farce...</font>

69
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And worse,
in the presence of the lord!</font>

70
00:03:21,510 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sir, the race has just begun.
Please watch it until the end.</font>

71
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:38,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you insist that much,
you had better win.</font>

72
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you lose...</font>

73
00:03:44,370 --> 00:03:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll ask for the dissolution
of your family!</font>

74
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Agreed! I'm a man of my word.</font>

75
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Idate loses,
you may do anything you wish.</font>

76
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How like Wasabi's Jirocho.
Such confidence.</font>

77
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't let us down.</font>

78
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Idate.</font>

79
00:04:18,230 --> 00:04:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

80
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me your money!</font>

81
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just be still!</font>

82
00:04:32,710 --> 00:04:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A starving thief, huh...</font>

83
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sh-Shut up!</font>

84
00:04:41,170 --> 00:04:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A kid trying to act tough!</font>

85
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that little thing,</font>

86
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can't even peel an apple,
can you?!</font>

87
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

88
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this.</font>

89
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:02,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Edged tools aren't
for hurting people.</font>

90
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have anywhere to go,
do you?</font>

91
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Jirocho of Wasabi
of Degarashi Port.</font>

92
00:05:16,370 --> 00:05:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasabi... Jirocho?</font>

93
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?
Why don't you come to my place?</font>

94
00:05:23,550 --> 00:05:25,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I just tried to...</font>

95
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone on the verge of starvation
will make such mistakes...</font>

96
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't hold it against you.</font>

97
00:05:35,770 --> 00:05:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah... this...</font>

98
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave it to you.
Keep it.</font>

99
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't ever do stupid things
like stealing...</font>

100
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Mister!</font>

101
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen!
Make me your henchman!</font>

102
00:05:54,330 --> 00:05:56,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I mean...
could you please, Boss!</font>

103
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your name?</font>

104
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...
My name is Idate Morino.</font>

105
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go then, Idate?</font>

106
00:06:12,890 --> 00:06:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss, just trust in me!
I will win, no matter what!</font>

107
00:06:22,730 --> 00:06:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can catch up
to him in a bit!</font>

108
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's too late now!</font>

109
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't win if
he's this far from the port!</font>

110
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, he may've planned to come
this way from the very beginning.</font>

111
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

112
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

113
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How lucky!</font>

114
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:53,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, we can stop them here.</font>

115
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate...</font>

116
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would've thought
they'd be escorting him.</font>

117
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Double Lucky!
Now I can pay them back.</font>

118
00:07:10,530 --> 00:07:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For what they did to us
during the Chunin Exams.</font>

119
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:18,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two go ahead.
I'll keep them here.</font>

120
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:19,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

121
00:07:22,250 --> 00:07:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally, we've caught up to you!</font>

122
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait!</font>

123
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:28,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Geez! Why on earth
did you come this way?!</font>

124
00:07:28,970 --> 00:07:31,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!
It's none of your business!</font>

125
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kinda attitude is that?!</font>

126
00:07:33,470 --> 00:07:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said to shut up!</font>

127
00:07:38,930 --> 00:07:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch out!</font>

128
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They aren't aware of it, are they?</font>

129
00:07:42,690 --> 00:07:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of Genjutsu?</font>

130
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I said wait up!</font>

131
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've already been here?</font>

132
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn! Looks like
I've been tricked by Genjutsu.</font>

133
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha-?!
If that's the case...</font>

134
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

135
00:08:04,290 --> 00:08:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

136
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

137
00:08:06,590 --> 00:08:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Don't go that way!</font>

138
00:08:11,550 --> 00:08:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's going on?</font>

139
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm out of it!</font>

140
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just be still!</font>

141
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll get pulled up now!</font>

142
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close...</font>

143
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A double Genjutsu.</font>

144
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty elaborate trick.</font>

145
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot! It's your fault that
we're going through all this!</font>

146
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

147
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, stop! Stop, I said!</font>

148
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Ninja tools!</font>

149
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was an unnecessary help!</font>

150
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say unnecessary?!</font>

151
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey bastard, can't you even
thank us for saving you?!</font>

152
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saved me
because it's your duty!</font>

153
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need to thank you!</font>

154
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

155
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Naruto. He's right.</font>

156
00:09:12,190 --> 00:09:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you don't want to die,
you should stay close to us.</font>

157
00:09:17,870 --> 00:09:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, where are you going?!</font>

158
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you going back
to Port Degarashi?</font>

159
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid, I'm heading north from here!</font>

160
00:09:25,710 --> 00:09:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">North? Is it faster that way?</font>

161
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

162
00:09:31,090 --> 00:09:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows...
I really don't trust this guy!</font>

163
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is why Ninja are no good.</font>

164
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

165
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this time of year,</font>

166
00:09:40,350 --> 00:09:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a strong seasonal wind blows
across this ocean...</font>

167
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the starting point, I watched the clouds
and realized it...</font>

168
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:50,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That the wind was coming.</font>

169
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:53,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that,
at the port to the north,</font>

170
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's an ocean current
that flows straight to Nagi Island.</font>

171
00:09:56,650 --> 00:10:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This part is different from you guys.
Right here!</font>

172
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:10,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it's getting a bit rough.</font>

173
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't push it!</font>

174
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Head more towards the south!</font>

175
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that'll take up quite some time.</font>

176
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once we get on the land,
no one can run faster than I can.</font>

177
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My victory is already set!</font>

178
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

179
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I taste salt in the air.</font>

180
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the ocean!</font>

181
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it that far out on the ocean?</font>

182
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the halfway point...
Nagi Island where Modoroki shrine is.</font>

183
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can get there within an hour.
Wait for a sec.</font>

184
00:11:09,770 --> 00:11:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old man, I'm here!
It's Idate from the Wasabi Family!</font>

185
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, I've been waiting for you.</font>

186
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like I was right.</font>

187
00:11:18,570 --> 00:11:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll need you to lend me a boat.</font>

188
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. I have it ready.</font>

189
00:11:23,530 --> 00:11:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Use that boat.</font>

190
00:11:28,330 --> 00:11:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the fastest boat around here.</font>

191
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm grateful to you!</font>

192
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem. Boss Jirocho has done
so much for me.</font>

193
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, don't lose to Wagarashi!</font>

194
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:42,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fed up with how
they handle things.</font>

195
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

196
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may be down on my luck now,</font>

197
00:11:46,260 --> 00:11:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'm Idate, the number one
henchman of the Wasabi Family!</font>

198
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest easy and leave it all to me!</font>

199
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, right.</font>

200
00:12:14,830 --> 00:12:17,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should start seeing
Nagi Island's port soon.</font>

201
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:20,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope we can get there
before Fukusuke.</font>

202
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto...
What do you think?</font>

203
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? What about?</font>

204
00:12:33,810 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Idate...</font>

205
00:12:36,110 --> 00:12:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's definitely not
an ordinary man.</font>

206
00:12:42,610 --> 00:12:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can run extraordinarily fast.</font>

207
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:48,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He could have received
special training...</font>

208
00:12:49,450 --> 00:12:50,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of training?</font>

209
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like, maybe he'd been
in a hidden village.</font>

210
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A guy that stupid can't be a Ninja!</font>

211
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:03,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's talking here?!
You're as stupid as he is!</font>

212
00:13:04,170 --> 00:13:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

213
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I made it to the final round
of the Chunin Exam!</font>

214
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:12,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were in the final round
of the Chunin Exam?!</font>

215
00:13:12,770 --> 00:13:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's right!</font>

216
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I weren't interrupted
in the middle of it,</font>

217
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could have won the tournament
and become a Chunin!</font>

218
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah!</font>

219
00:13:21,730 --> 00:13:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you must have had
a damn easy proctor.</font>

220
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, the level of
the Chunin Exam has dropped...</font>

221
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

222
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:33,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate, so you are...</font>

223
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember now!</font>

224
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:38,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate Morino.</font>

225
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morino... That's right!</font>

226
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't the proctor
of the first test....?</font>

227
00:13:44,090 --> 00:13:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet, you rotten runts!</font>

228
00:13:49,970 --> 00:13:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to have kept you waiting.</font>

229
00:13:51,970 --> 00:13:55,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the proctor for
the first test of the Chunin Exam.</font>

230
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Morino Ibiki.</font>

231
00:13:58,770 --> 00:14:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morino... Ibiki...</font>

232
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

233
00:14:02,570 --> 00:14:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother I-Ibiki is alive?!</font>

234
00:14:05,570 --> 00:14:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

235
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, he's alive!</font>

236
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He gave me a weird problem
on the 10th question...</font>

237
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true?
He really is alive?!</font>

238
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's this?!</font>

239
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An ambush!</font>

240
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is it?</font>

241
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you can see,
it's right in front of us.</font>

242
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, let's get started
on our plan!</font>

243
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn!</font>

244
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:53,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and I will chase them away!</font>

245
00:14:53,620 --> 00:14:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, take care of Idate!</font>

246
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it better to run...?</font>

247
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late for that!</font>

248
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll cover you. Remove the ropes!</font>

249
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha!</font>

250
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn! I have to cut these!</font>

251
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn it! I lost them all that time!</font>

252
00:15:19,890 --> 00:15:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, lend me that thing!</font>

253
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

254
00:15:22,730 --> 00:15:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just hand it to me, hurry!</font>

255
00:15:25,570 --> 00:15:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard, this is more important
than my life.</font>

256
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way
I'll let you use it...</font>

257
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no time to be saying
stuff like that!</font>

258
00:15:33,950 --> 00:15:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop you idiot!</font>

259
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up, you loser!</font>

260
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, piece of cake!</font>

261
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! They are just clones!</font>

262
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the real one can attack you,
so don't worry!</font>

263
00:15:57,930 --> 00:15:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

264
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, Naruto!</font>

265
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real ones are hiding among
the clones! Be careful!</font>

266
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Guide us!</font>

267
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate, stay close to me!</font>

268
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:15,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! I don't want a Ninja's help!</font>

269
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still saying that
in this situation?!</font>

270
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Behind you!</font>

271
00:16:24,330 --> 00:16:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

272
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A clone?!</font>

273
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, shoot!</font>

274
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Clone for clone!
— Clone for clone!</font>

275
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, they got away.</font>

276
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice work! Naruto!</font>

277
00:16:40,350 --> 00:16:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Shadow Clone kid
is troublesome.</font>

278
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next plan, Kagari!</font>

279
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll kill them all!</font>

280
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style!
Black Rain Jutsu!</font>

281
00:16:55,030 --> 00:16:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! They've changed
into Water Clones!</font>

282
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

283
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rain?</font>

284
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! This is oil!</font>

285
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How annoying!
I'll get rid of them all at once!</font>

286
00:17:15,630 --> 00:17:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Tiger Seal!</font>

287
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, no!</font>

288
00:17:22,270 --> 00:17:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oops...</font>

289
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlucky...</font>

290
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph, not really.</font>

291
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire attack?!</font>

292
00:17:53,170 --> 00:17:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Brother...</font>

293
00:17:55,010 --> 00:17:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Having you stay will be
a burden to me!</font>

294
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Brother...</font>

295
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate?</font>

296
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Nothing!</font>

297
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, what can we do?!</font>

298
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the fire is this strong...</font>

299
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:14,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have to dive in
to the ocean!</font>

300
00:18:14,820 --> 00:18:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here, we can swim
to the port of Nagi Island!</font>

301
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! There's no other option left.</font>

302
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate, can you swim?</font>

303
00:18:21,490 --> 00:18:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah...</font>

304
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:30,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry! I'll cover you, so go first!</font>

305
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This smoke should help you
escape unnoticed!</font>

306
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:35,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate?!</font>

307
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way!</font>

308
00:18:36,970 --> 00:18:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

309
00:18:37,970 --> 00:18:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are tricking me into
becoming a decoy!</font>

310
00:18:41,890 --> 00:18:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?!</font>

311
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're trying to get
the enemy's attention to me!</font>

312
00:18:46,770 --> 00:18:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's nonsense!</font>

313
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:50,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I don't trust Ninja!</font>

314
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing? Go!</font>

315
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having you stay will be
a burden to us!</font>

316
00:18:58,320 --> 00:19:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Having you stay
is a burden!</font>

317
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:04,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go!</font>

318
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way we will
use you as a decoy!</font>

319
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No...</font>

320
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

321
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate! Duck down!</font>

322
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trust me Idate!
I promise I'll protect you!</font>

323
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch out!</font>

324
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa...!</font>

325
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

326
00:19:46,450 --> 00:19:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura...</font>

327
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go on ahead...</font>

328
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll follow you right after!</font>

329
00:19:53,630 --> 00:19:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-All right...</font>

330
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, shall we withdraw now?</font>

331
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw?</font>

332
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most enjoyable part
is still left undone.</font>

333
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn, they are
unexpectedly tenacious.</font>

334
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. But we won't
let them get away.</font>

335
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I should be okay here...</font>

336
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see, Idate.</font>

337
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are...</font>

338
00:20:55,310 --> 00:20:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have taught you so many times
not to trust anyone.</font>

339
00:21:01,230 --> 00:21:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a fool, you are...</font>

340
00:21:05,950 --> 00:21:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

341
00:21:05,950 --> 00:21:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

342
00:21:10,950 --> 00:21:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

343
00:21:10,950 --> 00:21:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

344
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

345
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

346
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

347
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

348
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

349
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

350
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

351
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

352
00:21:35,970 --> 00:21:45,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

353
00:21:35,970 --> 00:21:45,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

354
00:21:45,280 --> 00:21:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

355
00:21:45,280 --> 00:21:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

356
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

357
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

358
00:21:54,430 --> 00:21:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

359
00:21:54,430 --> 00:21:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

360
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

361
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

362
00:22:05,010 --> 00:22:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

363
00:22:05,010 --> 00:22:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

364
00:22:13,210 --> 00:22:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

365
00:22:13,210 --> 00:22:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

366
00:22:23,890 --> 00:22:31,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

367
00:22:23,890 --> 00:22:31,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

368
00:22:31,330 --> 00:22:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

369
00:22:31,330 --> 00:22:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

370
00:22:38,290 --> 00:22:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Fool or whatever...
It doesn't matter now how you used to be.</font>

371
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This race is not over yet!</font>

372
00:22:45,340 --> 00:22:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You'll never know unless
you try 'til the very end!</font>

373
00:22:49,260 --> 00:22:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Boss Jirocho believes in you.</font>

374
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If you have time to stall and act cool,
why don't you show some guts?!</font>

375
00:22:58,310 --> 00:23:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Run Idate! The Stormy Disturbance of Nagi Island!!"</font>

